# Fault scen_ask_world (writer 6): the base printed `WARN-UNREAD source t` for a source that only the scenario's version
# cites. L §5.2: "a source that no version cites gets WARN-UNREAD"; a scenario's versions are ordinary versions (L §6.4).
# s is cited by nothing: it stays. The scenario's opening of konto is 5.00 DUK (r).
=== b.tally
model b
  tally 2
  on 2025-12-31
  start 2025-01-01
  end 2025-12-31

source s "s"

source t "t"

unit DUK: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts DUK lives 2025-01-01..
=== sc.tally
scenario sc over b
  tally 2
  from 2025-01-01



ask r: bal(konto, 2025-12-31) in sc

version v
  cite t
  known 2025-01-01
  opening[konto] = 5.00 at 2025-01-01 start "o"
=== expect
r: 5.00 DUK
  world: sc
  cut 2025-12-31
warning: WARN-UNREAD source s is read by nothing
